WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
WebScaly. Video enhancement on your device.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
Open WebScaly on a website you trust. Click Add this website.

00:07.000 --> 00:12.000
Choose Allow when Chrome asks. You can remove website access at any time.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Turn on Enhancement. Select Anime4K CNN and Quality.
Spatial Detail and FSRCNNX are also available.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Actual WebScaly output: Enhancement OFF on the left, ON on the right.
540p source to 1080p output. Original AI-generated demonstration artwork.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.000
The same eye and hair detail, magnified equally 2×.
No sharpening was added in the editor.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
The same comparison on a frame from Hero.
Anime4K cleans the illustrated contours.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Hero in motion: the same decoded frames on both sides.
960×402 source to 1920×804 enhancement output.

00:36.000 --> 00:43.000
Enable Compare and drag the divider to check the difference.
Optional player tools start hidden.

00:43.000 --> 00:50.000
Adjust output size and quality. Keep a profile for each website.
Manage your approved sites in advanced settings.

00:50.000 --> 00:58.000
Local processing. No telemetry. Site access by choice.
Free and open source. Results depend on source quality and available graphics support.
